# =========================
# Quest / robot-local assets
# =========================
# The YAM MJCF and gripper XML are supplied by a local i2rt checkout; the
# vendored teleop runtime only stores the kinematics integration in this repo.
# No trailing slash: the checkout is just as often a symlink to one kept
# elsewhere on the box, and `i2rt/` matches only a real directory.
i2rt
certs/
cams.env
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
MJMODEL.TXT
MJDATA.TXT
*.mjb

